          "key": "stage_indicators",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Water Damage active-work indicators",
          "items": [
            "Active flow, standing water, or inaccessible shutoff remains",
            "Electrical equipment, outlets, or wiring may be wet",
            "Ceiling sag, structural movement, or falling material is present",
            "Sewage, groundwater, chemicals, or unknown contamination suspected",
            "Visible growth, odor, prolonged wetness, or hidden cavity concern",
            "Multiple rooms, units, floors, or adjoining properties affected",
            "Contents or moisture-sensitive equipment needs controlled movement",
            "Emergency drying, extraction, containment, or temporary relocation began"
